        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\ninstall_result = await run_command(\"uv pip install openpyxl\")\nprint(install_result)\n\nimport asyncio\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\nverify = await run_command('python -c \"import openpyxl; print(\\'ok\\')\"')\nprint(verify)\n\nread_script = \"\"\"\nimport openpyxl\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('testbed/data/order_summary.xlsx')\nfor sheet_name in wb.sheetnames:\n    ws = wb[sheet_name]\n    print(f\"=== Sheet: {sheet_name} ===\")\n    print(f\"Rows: {ws.max_row}, Columns: {ws.max_column}\")\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=1, max_row=ws.max_row, values_only=True):\n        print(row)\n    print()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./read_order.py\", read_script)\norder_data = await run_command(\"python ./read_order.py\")\nprint(order_data)\n\ninv_script = \"\"\"\nimport openpyxl\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('testbed/data/product_inventory.xlsx')\nfor sheet_name in wb.sheetnames:\n    ws = wb[sheet_name]\n    print(f\"=== Sheet: {sheet_name} ===\")\n    print(f\"Rows: {ws.max_row}, Columns: {ws.max_column}\")\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=1, max_row=ws.max_row, values_only=True):\n        print(row)\n    print()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./read_inventory.py\", inv_script)\ninventory_data = await run_command(\"python ./read_inventory.py\")\nprint(inventory_data)\n```",
